  "behavior": "Both opt-in features default off. Existing valid server close reply policy retained. Header-read-budget only server role checks complete header protocol eligibility and data aggregate remaining budget before reading payload; control frames do not consume that budget. Client/default paths unchanged. No RST/linger/buffer-size changes, no full control-error parity claim.",
