  },
  "permessage_deflate": {
    "status": "IMPLEMENTED_NOT_RUN",
    "scope": "No-context-takeover raw DEFLATE producer/fragmented consumer and actual RSV1 behavior. Native max_message_size counts wire bytes; optional independent max_decompressed_message_size defaults None. Authenticated RTC binds both caps to signal_message_size_limit, with decoded overflow mapped to normal Close1000 and wire overflow to1009 in the signal consumer. Raw socket callers own negotiation.",
